<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN"
  "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
    <key>CFBundleDevelopmentRegion</key><string>ko</string>
    <key>CFBundleDisplayName</key><string>JARVIS</string>
    <key>CFBundleExecutable</key><string>$(EXECUTABLE_NAME)</string>
    <key>CFBundleIdentifier</key><string>$(PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER)</string>
    <key>CFBundleInfoDictionaryVersion</key><string>6.0</string>
    <key>CFBundleName</key><string>$(PRODUCT_NAME)</string>
    <key>CFBundlePackageType</key><string>APPL</string>
    <key>CFBundleShortVersionString</key><string>$(MARKETING_VERSION)</string>
    <key>CFBundleVersion</key><string>$(CURRENT_PROJECT_VERSION)</string>
    <key>JARVISRemoteMac</key><string>$(JARVIS_REMOTE_MAC)</string>
    <key>JARVISRemotePhone</key><string>$(JARVIS_REMOTE_PHONE)</string>
    <key>CFBundleURLTypes</key>
    <array><dict>
        <key>CFBundleURLName</key><string>dev.dechive.jarvis.mobile</string>
        <key>CFBundleURLSchemes</key><array><string>jarvis</string></array>
    </dict></array>
    <key>LSRequiresIPhoneOS</key><true/>
    <key>NSMicrophoneUsageDescription</key><string>사용자가 음성 버튼을 누르면 한국어 음성 명령을 듣기 위해 마이크를 사용합니다.</string>
    <key>NSSpeechRecognitionUsageDescription</key><string>JARVIS에서 한국어 음성 명령을 기기 내에서 인식합니다.</string>
    <key>NSAlarmKitUsageDescription</key><string>JARVIS에서 사용자가 설정한 기상 알람을 정해진 시각에 울리기 위해 사용합니다.</string>
    <key>NSLocalNetworkUsageDescription</key><string>사용자가 승인하면 근처 Mac JARVIS와 암호화된 연결로 일정을 동기화합니다.</string>
    <key>NSBonjourServices</key>
    <array><string>_jarvis-cal-v1._tcp</string></array>
    <key>UISupportedInterfaceOrientations</key>
    <array><string>UIInterfaceOrientationPortrait</string></array>
    <key>UILaunchScreen</key><dict/>
    <key>UIApplicationSceneManifest</key>
    <dict><key>UIApplicationSupportsMultipleScenes</key><true/></dict>
</dict>
</plist>
